{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Welcome to <strong>Bogos Binted?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588490/extras/bogos_binted_gif5.gif?t=1745539705\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to a sinful night with the galaxy\u2019s craziest aliens! Not every alien visits Earth to witness the indomitable human spirit. Some just want to chill on the Moon's surface and play games. But of course, these aren\u2019t <i>normal</i> games. Alien humor is... how should we put it... a bit <i>off.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588490/extras/bogos_binted_gif4.gif?t=1745539705\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this <strong>first-person, four-player, online multiplayer</strong> space adventure, every alien at the table must do whatever it takes to win in a variety of tabletop games. You\u2019ll craft sneaky strategies, tell outrageous lies, and blow up the heads of so-called \u201cfriends.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588490/extras/bogos_binted_gif2.gif?t=1745539705\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Two Game Modes in Early Access!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ZOGBLORP:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each player gets a deck made of number and special cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players take turns playing number cards to build a shared total.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With special cards, you can mess with your opponents\u2019 minds in beautifully evil ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The total number in the middle must not exceed the target number for that round.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If a player is forced to go over the limit, their head inflates. If they survive the inflation, they stay in the game. If their brain explodes... well, good luck in their next life.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588490/extras/bogos_binted_gif6.gif?t=1745539705\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>VORP:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the start of each round, roles are given. One player becomes the VORP \u2014 the imposter alien.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A topic card is chosen, along with a secret word. (Example: Animals \u2013 Orangutan)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everyone except VORP can see the secret word.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each player writes a clue related to the word. VORP has to fake it and try to guess the word from context.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The discussion begins. Accusations fly. Everyone votes on who they think the VORP is.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If the most-voted player <strong>is</strong> the VORP, they lose one life. If they\u2019re <strong>not</strong>, then everyone except the real VORP loses a life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Anyone who loses all their lives must face their alien god in the afterlife :)))</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588490/extras/bogos_binted_gif9.gif?t=1745539705\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">See You In The Game!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take your seat in <strong>Bogos Binted?</strong> right now and dive into chaotic fun with the galaxy\u2019s most disposable, big-eyed companions. Just remember: no one here tells you to \u201cplay fair.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They\u2019re aliens. They don\u2019t even speak English.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3588490?t=1745539705","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3588490?t=1745539705","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588490/6464a85d1cf8722908712be425bf92d492e58668/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745539705","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588490/6464a85d1cf8722908712be425bf92d492e58668/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745539705","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Bu oyunda her ya\u015fa uygun olmayan veya i\u015f yerinde g\u00f6r\u00fcnt\u00fclenmesi sak\u0131ncal\u0131 olabilecek i\u00e7erikler yer alabilir."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Welcome to <strong>Bogos Binted?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588490/extras/bogos_binted_gif5.gif?t=1745539705\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to a sinful night with the galaxy\u2019s craziest aliens! Not every alien visits Earth to witness the indomitable human spirit. Some just want to chill on the Moon's surface and play games. But of course, these aren\u2019t <i>normal</i> games. Alien humor is... how should we put it... a bit <i>off.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i