ord. (Example: Animals \u2013 Orangutan)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everyone except VORP can see the secret word.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each player writes a clue related to the word. VORP has to fake it and try to guess the word from context.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The discussion begins. Accusations fly. Everyone votes on who they think the VORP is.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If the most-voted player <strong>is</strong> the VORP, they lose one life. If they\u2019re <strong>not</strong>, then everyone except the real VORP loses a life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Anyone who loses all their lives must face their alien god in the afterlife :)))</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588490/extras/bogos_binted_gif9.gif?t=1745539705\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">See You In The Game!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take your seat in <strong>Bogos Binted?</strong> right now and dive into chaotic fun with the galaxy\u2019s most disposable, big-eyed companions. Just remember: no one here tells you to \u201cplay fair.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They\u2019re aliens. They don\u2019t even speak English.</p>","developers":["Bad Badger"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588490/dbe06e49992d24c5a1a4734a793ecb34051eebb6/header.jpg?t=1745539705","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Bogos Binted?","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Memory